  "prompts": {
    "human": "Welcome to Irish Poker, the ultimate prediction game. You have 4 face-down cards. Round 1: Guess Red or Black on card 1 (give/take 2 drinks). Round 2: Higher or Lower than card 1 on card 2 (give/take 4). Round 3: Inside or Outside the first two on card 3 (give/take 6). Round 4: Guess the Suit of card 4 (give/take 8). Strategy: Remember your cards and use probability!",
    "ai": "Game: Irish Poker (Drinking/Social). 2-10 players, 52-card deck. Setup: 4 face-down cards per player. Rounds: 1-Red/Black (guess color), 2-Higher/Lower (vs card 1), 3-Inside/Outside (vs cards 1-2), 4-Suit (guess suit). Scoring: Correct round = give drinks 2,4,6,8. Wrong = take drinks. Social winner: lowest total drinks."
  },
